          "event_id": "lite_evt_00005",
          "explanation": "The doctor uses the workspace to query records, which is a positive step to ground advice in available information.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台。 可见既往/CareLoop 中心医院记录 5 条。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was partially met as the doctor used the workspace to access records and did not make unsupported claims about pathology or prognosis. However, the serious errors in RC1 and RC2 overshadow any partial success here.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
