          "quote": "拟施手术方式、名称及可能的变更：1、手术名称（方式）：经腔镜纵隔肿瘤切除术"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 requirements were partially addressed, but the serious errors in RC1 and RC2 prevent this from being a cleanly met responsibility.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
